@startuml
' Source Use Case: UC-012 — Shuffle Garment Slot
' Primary Specification: ../use-cases/UC-012-shuffle-garment-slot.md
' Supporting Authorities: ../SRS.md (v0.3); ../business-rules.md (v0.1.2)
' Business/Product: ../../01-business/BRD.md (v0.3); ../../02-product/PRD.md (v0.2)
' Master Actors/Scope: ../use-cases/use-case-diagram.puml
' Process Authority: ../../../Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 11, 39–42, 46
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft
' SRS trace: FR-OUT-014, FR-OUT-015, FR-OUT-016, FR-OUT-017, ERR-OUT-003, FR-OUT-009
' Rule trace: BRULE-AUTH-001, BRULE-OUT-008, BRULE-OUT-010
' Flow coverage: UC Sections 6–10; alternatives and failures retain their textual meaning.
' The textual Use Case Specification remains the normative behavioral source.

title AD-012 - Shuffle Garment Slot
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

|User|
start
:Select one supported slot and request Shuffle;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Authorized access usable?) then (Yes)
    :Identify selected owned outfit and request context;
else (No)
    :Pause protected use; require renewed access (UC-002);
    stop
endif
repeat
    if (Outfit/context still current?) then (Yes)
        :Hold all other constituent identities and context fixed;
    else (No)
        :Explain changed/Outdated basis;
        |User|
        :Refresh through UC-011 before a new Shuffle;
        stop
    endif
    |CapsuleAI|
    :Identify different eligible owned alternatives
for only the selected slot;
    :Apply readiness and full-outfit hard compatibility;
    if (Replacement result available?) then (Yes)
        if (Compatible alternative exists?) then (Yes)
            :Replace only selected slot;
            :Present resulting valid outfit and reasons;
        else (No)
            :Retain current selection;
            :Explain no compatible owned alternative;
        endif
        |User|
        :Review changed outfit or retained selection;
    else (Unavailable)
        |CapsuleAI|
        :Explain unavailable replacement result;
        :Retain prior selection where available;
        |User|
        :Review prior selection before retry;
    endif
    if (Continue slot exploration?) then (Yes)
        :Explicitly choose next Shuffle slot or retry;
        |CapsuleAI|
        :Identify this action's outfit and fixed context;
    endif
    |User|
repeat while (Another explicit Shuffle requested?) is (Yes) not (No)
|CapsuleAI|
:Finish with replacement, no-alternative
or disclosed unavailable result;
note right
  Other slots and assessment context stay fixed.
  Shuffle creates no Like, Dislike or Wear Event.
end note
stop

@enduml
